---

This project is an independent Russian adaptation of the structure and the
deterministic-linter approach of danyuchn/asd-ste100-skill (MIT, above). The
English rules of ASD-STE100 are not used here. The writing rules follow the
principles of GOST R 58049-2017, restated in the author's own words.